# VALUE

## SupervisorRequest

- input-kind :: COMMAND

### DESCRIPTION

Component operation projection of the CNCF Supervisor request contract.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name              | type    | multiplicity |
|-------------------+---------+--------------|
| requestId         | SupervisorRequestId         | 1            |
| idempotencyKey    | SupervisorIdempotencyKey    | 1            |
| targetId          | SupervisorTargetId          | 1            |
| deploymentId      | SupervisorDeploymentId      | ?            |
| action            | SupervisorActionName        | 1            |
| operatorSubjectId | SupervisorOperatorSubjectId | 1            |
| deadlineAt        | instant | 1            |

## SupervisorResult

### EXTENDS

OperationResult

### DESCRIPTION

Component operation projection of the CNCF Supervisor result contract.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name           | type    | multiplicity |
|----------------+---------+--------------|
| requestId      | SupervisorRequestId      | 1            |
| state          | SupervisorRequestState   | 1            |
| diagnosticCode | SupervisorDiagnosticCode | ?            |
| diagnostic     | SupervisorDiagnostic     | ?            |
| supervisorId   | SupervisorId             | 1            |
| instanceId     | SupervisorInstanceId     | ?            |
| acceptedAt     | instant | ?            |
| completedAt    | instant | ?            |

## SupervisorLookup

- input-kind :: QUERY

### DESCRIPTION

Request to look up one durable Supervisor request.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name      | type   | multiplicity |
|-----------+--------+--------------|
| requestId | SupervisorRequestId | 1            |

## SupervisorLookupResult

### EXTENDS

OperationResult

### DESCRIPTION

Lookup result. `result` is absent when the durable request is unknown.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name   | type             | multiplicity |
|--------+------------------+--------------|
| result | SupervisorResult | ?            |
